{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_07_this_in_methods_02_the_fixes_bind_in_constructor", "label": "bind in the constructor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/07-this-in-methods/02-the-fixes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Creates a new function with this fixed and stores it as an own property that shadows the prototype method. Binding is permanent."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_07_this_in_methods_02_the_fixes_arrow_class_field", "label": "Arrow class field", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/07-this-in-methods/02-the-fixes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Field initialiser runs with this bound to the instance; the arrow captures it lexically. Own property per instance; not overridable; no super."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_07_this_in_methods_02_the_fixes_wrap_at_call_site", "label": "Wrap at the call site", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/07-this-in-methods/02-the-fixes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "() => this.m() leaves the method a plain prototype method, costs nothing, stays overridable. Best default except removable listeners."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_07_this_in_methods_02_the_fixes_call_apply_thisarg_fix", "label": "call / apply / thisArg for one call", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/07-this-in-methods/02-the-fixes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sets this for one call, not permanently. Not a fix for the detached-method problem if you are already at the call site."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_07_this_in_methods_02_the_fixes_bind_works_once", "label": "bind only works once", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/07-this-in-methods/02-the-fixes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A bound function's this is permanent. Re-binding does nothing; call/apply cannot override it."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_07_this_in_methods_02_the_fixes_removeeventlistener_identity", "label": "removeEventListener identity trap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/07-this-in-methods/02-the-fixes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Removal matches by function identity. An inline arrow is a new function each time, so removeEventListener silently does nothing."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_07_this_in_methods_02_the_fixes_own_property_method_cost", "label": "Per-instance cost of bound or arrow methods", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/07-this-in-methods/02-the-fixes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "bind-in-constructor and arrow fields create one function object per instance and take the method off the prototype, blocking override and super."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_07_this_in_methods_02_the_fixes_page", "label": "07.2 \u00b7 The fixes, and which to choose", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/07-this-in-methods/02-the-fixes.md", 